    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A technique to guide the iterative sampling process of a diffusion model towards a conditioning signal by mixing conditional and unconditional outputs without an auxiliary classifier.</skos:skos_definition>
