    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">high order linear multi-step method Magorzata &amp; Marciniak (2002), which is also called the explicit Adams method, to sample efficiently</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/S0/R1#modality_specific_encoder">
