    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">aligning feature distributions and prediction distributions achieve better performance than PD, but fails to outperform the original L CFD which only uses temperature for the teacher.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
