    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Text Denoising U-Net Repres entations Images Pixel Space crossattention denoising step</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A representative example is U-Net based on a convolutional neural network</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the convolutional U-Net architecture (Ronneberger et al., 2015) has become the standard choice of diffusion backbone</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Rombach et al. [ RBL 22 ] modifies the U-Net architecture [ RFB15 ] for conditioning control with crossattenti</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the default DDPM U-Net architecture in pixel space is a natural and trivial baseline.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
