    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the forward process transforms the starting state into prior Gaussian noise</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">forward processalso known as the diffusion processwhich incrementally adds Gaussian noises to the real sample</hasEvidenceText>
