    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">use the validation set in COCO 2014 [ Lin et al. , 2014 ] for evaluation, and the CLIP [ Hessel et al. , 2021 ]/Aesthetic score [ Team , 2022 ] (higher is better) to assess the text-image alignment</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
