    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">with the default guidance scale s = 7 . 5 in their official code.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">We set the guidance scale to commonly used w =</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">with the default guidance scale s = 7 . 5 in their official code</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">guidance scale s</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">guidance weight w</hasEvidenceText>
