    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A paradigm of diffusion models that generalizes discrete diffusion steps into a continuous scenario using Stochastic Differential Equations (SDE).</skos:skos_definition>
