    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SGM generalizes the discrete diffusion steps into the continuous scenario and further models the diffusion process with the Stochastic Differential Equations (SDE).</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
