    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A diffusion process distinct from Gaussian diffusion in forward diffusion, training loss, and reverse diffusion, where transitions are applied multiplicatively.</skos:skos_definition>
